Light's derivatives (especially lightning, lighten, lighter, and highlight)
receive larger responses than the bare noun. Some related -ight spellings
also receive positive responses. Split spelling and suffixes use the previous
token. Most tokens get almost zero. Document openings have a negative baseline,
as does the colon of an opening Title: label. Smaller side rules cover Japanese
