A fragment continuing some/any/every/no/else + one/thing/body/where is
positive; whole-token words are not. Thai nasal-letter fragments are
another positive family. Digit 2 following letters is mildly positive.
Opening tokens have a case-dependent baseline,
except Python's ``def`` and the digits of an opening ``12``. An opening
``Title:`` label and repeated middle dots have negative responses.
