Recognize comment/docstring openers, indentation, quotes, line breaks and
bare ASCII letters at the start of a document. Initial repeated blank/separator
tokens retain the pulse. The colon completing an initial Title: header is
especially strong. Smaller fluctuations in ordinary text are ignored.
