Negative contributions mark finding, calculating, returning, and the start of
an object being requested. Infinitives, imperatives, questions, and recent
mathematical/request vocabulary adjust their strength. Future 'will find' gets
a positive adjustment. Two formatting rules handle leading carriage-return
tokens and an initial empty // comment line. This is a partial approximation,
not a general semantic parser.
